odal__media\">\n<img src=\"https://e01-marca.uecdn.es/deporte/suscripciones/ofertas//v352/images/papel-standard.png\" alt=\"Suscripci&oacute;n a Diario MARCA impresa y Orbyt\"/>\n<div class=\"ue-c-subscription-modal__gift\">\n </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ue-c-subscription-modal__content\">\n<h2 class=\"ue-c-subscription-modal__title\">Papel</h2>\n<h3>Con tu edici&oacute;n impresa y digital disfruta de:</h3>\n <ul class=\"ue-c-subscription-list\">\n<li class=\"ue-c-subscription-list__item\">\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 12\">\n<g fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\">\n<g fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\">\n<path d=\"M38.537 333L40 334.534 30.017 345 26 340.789 27.463 339.255 30.017 341.933z\" transform=\"translate(-26 -333)\"/>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg>\n<span>MARCA a diario, en tu casa o en tu quiosco habitual</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ue-c-subscription-list__item\">\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 12\">\n<g fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\">\n<g fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\">\n<path d=\"M38.537 333L40 334.534 30.017 345 26 340.789 27.463 339.255 30.017 341.933z\" transform=\"translate(-26 -333)\"/>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg>\n<span>Todos los suplementos</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ue-c-subscription-list__item\">\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 12\">\n<g fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\">\n<g fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\">\n<path d=\"M38.537 333L40 334.534 30.017 345 26 340.789 27.463 339.255 30.017 341.933z\" transform=\"translate(-26 -333)\"/>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg>\n<span>Acceso a la hemeroteca</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ue-c-subscription-list__item\">\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 12\">\n<g fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\">\n<g fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\">\n<path d=\"M38.537 333L40 334.534 30.017 345 26 340.789 27.463 339.255 30